HTTP Status Codes:
===============
GET
POST

100 : Informational

2XX : Success
		200 => OK
		201 => Created
		204 => Deleted

3XX : Redirectional
		302 => temp redirection
		301 => URL redirection
		304 => Cache

4XX : Client Errors
		404 => Not found
		400 => Bad request
		401 =>  Authentication 
		403 => Forbidden no permissions

5XX : Server Errors
		501 => internal server error
		503 => Service unavilable


Types of DNS Record:
=================

NS    => Name servers who is managing the domain
SOA   => Start of authority
A     => IPv4
AAAA  => IPv6
MX    => Mail records
TXT   => Verification
CNAME => Canonical name, alias name for another domain


